<title>FRANCE: EU traders book 400,000 T flour.</title>
<headline>EU traders book 400,000 T flour.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour traders bid for European Union export licences for 400,000 tonnes of wheat flour Tuesday at a fixed daily refund of five ecus per tonne, European grain industry sources said.</p>
<p>The bids were submitted across the EU before the European Commission late on Tuesday abolished the refund and replaced it with a &quot;nil value.&quot;</p>
</text>
